{#- An ad was reviewed (to the advertiser) · Ads. Sender: Ads\AdNotice::decided(), after the
    moderation queue approves, refuses or takes down an ad. Variables: first_name, decision
    ('approved' | 'refused' | 'taken_down'), campaign, headline, reason, ends_on (a trial's last
    day, or empty), manage_url, policy_url. Transactional: it is about the advertiser's own ad,
    and a decision they must act on cannot carry a way to switch it off. -#}
{% extends 'emails/_layout.html.twig' %}
{% block category %}Ads{% endblock %}
{% block why %}You placed an ad on Africa GATES.{% endblock %}
{% block subject %}{% if decision == 'approved' %}Your ad is approved: {{ headline }}{% elseif decision == 'taken_down' %}Your ad was taken down: {{ headline }}{% else %}Your ad needs a change: {{ headline }}{% endif %}{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}{% if decision == 'approved' %}It can run now. See its views and clicks in the Ads Manager.{% else %}The reason is below. Fix the ad and send it again.{% endif %}{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
{%- import 'emails/_blocks.html.twig' as b -%}
{% if decision == 'approved' %}
{{ b.h1('Your ad is approved') }}
{{ b.p("A person checked “#{headline}” in #{campaign} and it can run now.") }}
{% if ends_on %}{{ b.note("Your free trial runs until #{ends_on}, or until it reaches its views.") }}{% endif %}
{{ b.button('See its results', manage_url) }}
{% else %}
{{ b.h1(decision == 'taken_down' ? 'Your ad was taken down' : 'Your ad needs a change') }}
{{ b.p("A person checked “#{headline}” in #{campaign}. It is not showing for this reason:") }}
{{ b.warn(reason, 'Reason') }}
{{ b.button('Fix it and send it again', manage_url) }}
{{ b.note("The rules every ad follows are in the Advertising Policy: #{policy_url}") }}
{% endif %}
{{ b.sign('Thank you,', 'The Africa GATES team') }}
{% endblock %}
